              "recursive": false,
              "hidden": false,
              "description": "Show help for this command\nConfiguration\nSource and version resolve in this order: command line, environment\n(KOSMERA_SKILLS_SOURCE, KOSMERA_SKILLS_VERSION), CLI configuration\n(skills_source, skills_version), then the built-in default.\nDefault source: https://github.com/Locwise/kosmera-skills\nThe default source is a public repository; no sign-in is required.",
